 "post": {
  "title": "3 settings that stop scam calls",
  "caption": "3 settings that stop scam calls 📵\n\n1. Spam filter: on. iPhone: Settings › Apps › Phone › Spam. Android (Phone by Google): Phone › Settings › Caller ID & spam › Filter spam calls. Calls flagged as spam stop ringing.\n2. Screen unknown senders. iPhone: Messages › Manage Filtering › Screen Unknown Senders. Android (Google Messages): Settings › Spam protection. Texts from numbers you don't know go to their own list.\n3. Block the number. iPhone: Phone › Recents › ⓘ › Block Caller. Android: Recents › tap the number › Block / report spam.\n\nThree taps, two minutes. Save this, and send it to someone who still answers every call.",
